WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Temperature over time, from a fixed viewpoint.
The scale runs from cold to hot.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The view now rotates around a single snapshot.
Temperature fades into plasma β (thermal pressure / magnetic pressure).

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
From plasma β to Hα emission.
The Hα scale shows intrinsic emission per unit volume, from faint to bright.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
From Hα emission to particle number density.
The density scale runs from diffuse to dense.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
From density back to temperature.
